  "description_html": "Comparison between the wing<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Feathers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feathers\">feathers</a> of <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Archaeopteryx\" title=\"Archaeopteryx\">Archaeopteryx</a></i> and modern <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Birds\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Birds\">birds</a>. Wings of flightless birds (<i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Gallirallus\" title=\"Gallirallus\">Gallirallus</a></i> and <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Flightless_cormorant&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Flightless cormorant (page does not exist)\">flightless cormorant</a> (<i>phalacrocrocorax harrisi</i>)) and have feathers with very symmetrical vanes, while flying birds (see the other feathers) are asymmetrical. Many have suggested <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Archaeopteryx\" title=\"Archaeopteryx\">Archaeopteryx</a></i> was a poor flyer, based on different reasons. But at least the feathers indicate it was a proficient flyer.\n<p><b>References</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Buteo\" title=\"Buteo\">Buteo</a></i> based on <i><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://wapedia.mobi/thumb/e27f14605/en/fixed/470/909/Buteo_buteo_primary_secondary.jpg\">http://wapedia.mobi/thumb/e27f14605/en/fixed/470/909/Buteo_buteo_primary_secondary.jpg</a></i>.</li>\n<li>The <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Branta\" title=\"Branta\">Branta</a></i> are based on <i><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://www.lab.fws.gov/featheratlas/images/feathers/CAGO_wing_adult5415.jpg\" href=\"https://www.lab.fws.gov/featheratlas/images/feathers/CAGO_wing_adult5415.jpg\">http://www.lab.fws.gov/featheratlas/images/feathers/CAGO_wing_adult5415.jpg</a></i>.</li>\n<li>Flightless <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Phalacrocorax\" title=\"Phalacrocorax\">Phalacrocorax</a></i>: <i><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2347/1972229877_7b197488ce.jpg?v=0\">http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2347/1972229877_7b197488ce.jpg?v=0</a></i> and <i><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://atechworld.com/photo/misc/flightless_cormorant.jpg\">http://atechworld.com/photo/misc/flightless_cormorant.jpg</a></i>.</li></ul>",
